0A99   F1                     POP   AF   ; A = 0x80, Flags = 0x00
0A9A   3D                     DEC   A   ; Execute Opcode: 0x80 (-128) - 1 = 0x7F (+127). This is a signed overflow.
0A9B   F5                     PUSH   AF   
0A9C   D1                     POP   DE   ; Save results. D = Result (0x7F), E = New Flags
0A9D                          ; Verify Result
